            {
                "entry_id": "c6e9b783-44ee-3ca8-b845-24f8e5591ffb",
                "word": "environnementaliste",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "19a0c210-8c45-4d5b-a206-279cea3d4c46",
                        "entry_id": "c6e9b783-44ee-3ca8-b845-24f8e5591ffb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "environnementalistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff3a2a60-0dbb-310b-a4f2-c9ebc60e0d7c",
                        "entry_id": "c6e9b783-44ee-3ca8-b845-24f8e5591ffb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui étudie les relations entre l’être humain et son environnement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bd90764-d4ce-4839-b4d3-93a603ba9a3f",
                                "sense_id": "ff3a2a60-0dbb-310b-a4f2-c9ebc60e0d7c",
                                "text": "Henry David Thoreau (1817-1862) est considéré comme le premier environnementaliste."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b142731e-8291-3b80-9885-3089983abf34",
                        "entry_id": "c6e9b783-44ee-3ca8-b845-24f8e5591ffb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui milite pour la préservation ou la restauration de l’environnement et le respect de la nature."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfea4110-f4aa-4e7e-9bd0-50045faab458",
                                "sense_id": "b142731e-8291-3b80-9885-3089983abf34",
                                "text": "Les environnementalistes, comme la majorité des scientifiques, sont unanimes sur la question du réchauffement climatique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c162c4a4-579e-4f4a-bded-dcfce8ba3736",
                                "sense_id": "b142731e-8291-3b80-9885-3089983abf34",
                                "text": "Wangari Maathai, environnementaliste kényane, a été lauréate du prix Nobel de la Paix en 2004."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21f291a7-5f21-4926-a12a-8c4cfb96969a",
                                "sense_id": "b142731e-8291-3b80-9885-3089983abf34",
                                "text": "Il montre une facette étonnante de lui-même en prenant la posture de l’environnementaliste convaincu, puisqu’il décrit la manière dont les grandes agglomérations repoussent toujours plus loin les terres cultivables et crachent des fumées lourdes de pollution. — (Mikal Hem, Et si je devenais dictateur, traduit du norvégien par Jean-Baptiste Coursaud, Gaïa, 2017, page 148)"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8c44797-64ec-4e92-9a56-7d34ddb86f63",
                        "source_entry_id": "c6e9b783-44ee-3ca8-b845-24f8e5591ffb",
                        "target_lang_word": "environmentalist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "environmentalist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ed9ad5d-5f42-3edc-a753-4c9a59a1b878",
                                        "entry_id": "5400d892-527e-3b23-8e32-70cb0e6dff58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who advocates for the protection of the environment and biosphere from misuse from human activity through such measures as ecosystem protection, waste reduction and pollution prevention."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b85117e-bc67-4147-b72e-dd2732924ec6",
                                                "sense_id": "0ed9ad5d-5f42-3edc-a753-4c9a59a1b878",
                                                "text": "This tension is familiar in the lives of most environmentalists. Some own cars; some still eat meat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b870b3c-4598-4e34-9dbe-2eaa5c7a89bb",
                                                "sense_id": "0ed9ad5d-5f42-3edc-a753-4c9a59a1b878",
                                                "text": "The term greenwashing was coined by environmentalist Jay Westerveld in 1986, back when most consumers received their news from television, radio and print media – the same outlets that corporations regularly flooded with a wave of high-priced, slickly-produced commercials and print ads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f59c5d58-4973-4a21-b576-7733c8807caa",
                                                "sense_id": "0ed9ad5d-5f42-3edc-a753-4c9a59a1b878",
                                                "text": "A widening of the M4 had long been mooted, and the Welsh Government had even earmarked most of the required £1.6bn funding for a new 14-mile, six-lane section around Newport. Then, in the face of opposition from environmentalists, came a realisation that similar road schemes across the world tend merely to encourage greater car use and therefore soon prove ineffective in solving the original problem."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9b1ae13-28be-41d7-b098-f258d078171a",
                                                "sense_id": "0ed9ad5d-5f42-3edc-a753-4c9a59a1b878",
                                                "text": "He [King Charles] is a committed environmentalist at a point when the government is full of climate change deniers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecbace9c-29a2-35e4-abb6-b39f64cf3e33",
                                        "entry_id": "5400d892-527e-3b23-8e32-70cb0e6dff58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who holds the view that environment, rather than heredity or culture, is the primary factor in the development of an individual or group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbeba7b8-cb64-4df9-bfec-bffc9d74dc24",
                                                "sense_id": "ecbace9c-29a2-35e4-abb6-b39f64cf3e33",
                                                "text": "As we remarked once before, there are two extreme views with respect to life, one attributing everything to the environment, the other to inherent abilities. If, for example, an unusual number of distinguished men are born and reared in the same locality, the environmentalists assert that the causes for their appearance were entirely external and that had their parents changed habitats with those residing elsewhere the result would have been the same, except that the family names of these eminent men would have been different."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "environmentalist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed50eac6-2035-385a-94f9-691401f3017e",
                                        "entry_id": "fd48224f-16be-35df-bf5f-f44d8a257d9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, or relating to environmentalism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24090814-80ab-4a22-9dae-bf90f3397c04",
                                                "sense_id": "ed50eac6-2035-385a-94f9-691401f3017e",
                                                "text": "The environmentalist explanation would be that tropical environment retards or depresses culture through its physiological effect on the human organism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
